<title>USA: TCBY sees 1997 food, equipment revs rising.</title>
<headline>TCBY sees 1997 food, equipment revs rising.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCBY Enterprises Inc said on Thursday it expects revenues from food product and equipment sales to increase in 1997 due to continued expansion of co-branded locations and other manufacturing opportunities.</p>
<p>The company also said its executive management team members will only receive their full incentive bonuses if TCBY attains net income per share of $0.34 in 1997, which would be a 30 percent increase over 1996.</p>
</text>
